  <li class="project">
    <h3 class="project-name"><a href="https://todos.chriswatnee.com">Todos</a></h3>
    <p class="project-description">
      A to-do list that looks and feels like a late-80s adventure game, with EGA
      colors, beveled buttons and a text-parser prompt. It works with your
      Todoist tasks using the same commands as Todoist's <code>td</code>
      command-line tool, and clicking a button types the command out for you so
      you learn them as you go.
    </p>
    <p class="project-meta">
      <span>Vanilla JS, Vite, Todoist API, Cloudflare</span>
      <span>·</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/chriswatnee/todos">Source</a>
    </p>
  </li>
  <li class="project">
    <h3 class="project-name"><a href="https://status.rodeo">Status Rodeo</a></h3>
    <p class="project-description">
      Short statuses from a small herd of friends. It started as a way to post a
      status and show the latest one on this site, and grew into a tiny social
      network with profiles, link previews, hat tips and RSS feeds.
    </p>
    <p class="project-meta">
      <span>Vanilla JS, Vite, Supabase, Cloudflare Pages</span>
      <span>·</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/chriswatnee/status-rodeo">Source</a>
    </p>
  </li>
